<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Skoda H1 '96 consolidated results.</title>
<headline>Czech Skoda H1 '96 consolidated results.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated results for the</p>
<p>six-month period ending June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 450.273</p>
<p> Operational Profit	   867.897</p>
<p>Sales of products</p>
<p> and services		 4,736.922</p>
<p> Write-offs		     469.912</p>
<p> Assets			29.779.000</p>
<p> Basic capital		9.479.000</p>
<p>Comparative figures ewre not available.</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name in Skoda a.s.. Results were provided directly by the firm.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
